      <li>"Is NEET compulsory for BSc Nursing?"</li>
      <li>"I am scoring 450 and my parents want me to take a BUMS seat. I want another drop."</li>
      <li>"What should I do if my NEET is not qualifying?"</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="callout__footer">
      Short answers: it depends on the score band and the fee. Nursing depends on your state. A drop year needs a
      plan. And "not qualifying" still leaves several serious routes open.
    </p>
  </div>

