  <h2 id="parents">If you are a parent</h2>

  <p>
    Your job is to improve the quality of the decision, not to replace it. Ask better questions: what is the
    total fee in writing, what is the college's placement denominator, which regulator notification does it admit
    under, and what happens if the exam goes badly? A relative's story is not data, and a broker's promise is
    not a seat.
  </p>

  <div class="callout callout--amber">
